# What never gets committed. When you add a new kind of local or generated
# file, add it here and note it in AGENTS.md.

# Dependencies. There are none, and there should stay none (AGENTS.md, rule 1).
node_modules/

# SQLite databases and their WAL/journal side files. GATHER_DB can point at
# any path, so the common extensions are covered, not just gather.db.
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite-*
*.sqlite3-*

# Local configuration and secrets. Copy .env.example to .env.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# Generated. `npm run preview:email` rebuilds the preview.
# public/index.html is generated too, but it is committed on purpose so the
# repo works without a build step (AGENTS.md, rule 6). Do not ignore it.
public/email-preview.html
coverage/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Editors and IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Agent tools: personal, machine-local settings only. Shared agent files such
# as AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md are committed.
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# Operating systems
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
